  journalLore: Boar gone sour in the blighted thickets. They graze where nothing should grow any more, and Eirik won't eat the meat until it has been cooked twice.
  journalAdvice: It leaves you alone at a distance. Step too close and it charges straight at you, then stands blown and open when the charge is spent. Roll aside, and strike it then.
  journalHabitat: Blighted thickets and clearings, in both the Misty Woods and Troll Valley
